  "body": "What is missing: the split of the 3D Finish test into six bands loses two checks. The levels near each band edge move by less than one stepdown. The links between bands are never generated.\n\nEvidence: `crates/app/tests/shared_face_bodies_finish.rs` and the decision file of PR #1846 (\"What it does not prove\"). The old whole-span test covered both.\n\nFound in the review of PR #1846. Part of #1715.\n\nDone means: a test asserts the band-edge levels and the link moves between two bands. The test is in the heavy lane, or uses a small fixture in the default suite.\n",
